  "intentions": [
   "The arrival foyer remains a deliberately compressed, shaded threshold before opening through the gallery into the garden-facing great room.",
   "Living, dining and kitchen form a continuous social interior that spills south to the covered veranda and pool garden.",
   "The east ground suite is buffered by its own vestibule and private lounge for resort-like privacy.",
   "All bedroom doors are reached from galleries or vestibules, never directly from the public living spaces.",
   "The sculptural stair rises into a generous upper gallery, turning circulation into a daylit overlook between the offset bedroom volumes.",
   "Upper lounges and bedrooms are oriented to varied north, south, east and west outlooks so the asymmetrical massing reads differently from every side."
  ]
 },
